	(descr "PHYTEC phyCORE-AM62x PCM-071, module outline and M2.5 mounting holes. NO PADS -- the 240 contacts belong to J26/J27, the two BTH-060 receptacles. The module is fitted by hand after assembly, so this is excluded from the position file. Outline and hole positions from PCM-071_1573-1.dxf (BOARD_OUTLINE 32.000 x 43.000; holes at 2.800/2.800 and 29.200/40.200, 2.600 drill, 4.000 plating). Stands 5 mm off the board on two M2.5 F-F standoffs. See som.md section 11.")
